WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.366 --> 00:00:06.233
Setting his sights on entering the Kalos League,

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:09.233
Ash challenged and successfully defeated Viola,

3
00:00:09.299 --> 00:00:11.033
the Santalune City Gym Leader,

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.000
and earned his first badge in the Kalos region!

5
00:00:16.366 --> 00:00:18.633
So, Serena, where are you headed from here?

6
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:24.366
- Uh, me? Well, I... Uh... I'm...
- Why don't you come along with us?

7
00:00:24.433 --> 00:00:27.900
- Pika!
- Yeah, that'd be fun!

8
00:00:27.966 --> 00:00:29.900
Come with us! We'll have a great time!

9
00:00:29.966 --> 00:00:32.833
Yeah! Sounds like an excellent idea to me!

10
00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:36.066
Thanks to you, I came up with a my Santalune Gym strategy!

11
00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:39.900
And if you could help me from here on out, uh, it would be great.

12
00:00:39.966 --> 00:00:45.400
Hm. Sure! How could I say no to all that?

13
00:00:45.466 --> 00:00:47.800
- All right!
- Yeah, that's the spirit!

14
00:00:47.866 --> 00:00:49.400
Huh!

15
00:00:51.199 --> 00:00:52.833
Come on!

16
00:00:54.066 --> 00:00:57.733
Ash, you're planning to travel to the Cyllage Gym next, aren't you?

17
00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:00.466
- Yeah!
- Well, I can show you how to get there.

18
00:01:00.533 --> 00:01:03.433
Ta-da! Here's where we are now.

19
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.100
Santalune City. But look here.

20
00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:09.500
Lumiose City is between us and Cyllage City.

21
00:01:09.566 --> 00:01:12.966
So we have to travel back through Lumiose City before we get there!

22
00:01:14.433 --> 00:01:17.366
- I guess you're right!
- Great!

23
00:01:17.433 --> 00:01:20.366
There's a boutique in Lumiose City with the cutest clothes!

24
00:01:20.433 --> 00:01:22.399
And there's an awesome bakery that has

25
00:01:22.466 --> 00:01:25.366
the best pastries you ever tasted!

26
00:01:25.433 --> 00:01:27.766
What are we waiting for? Let's hurry up!

27
00:01:27.833 --> 00:01:29.200
Yippee!

28
00:01:29.266 --> 00:01:31.800
Clemont, step on it!

29
00:01:31.866 --> 00:01:34.333
Ah. I'm doing my best!

30
00:01:39.699 --> 00:01:41.699
As long as we're going to Lumiose City,

31
00:01:41.766 --> 00:01:44.433
I'd really like to take a shot at a Lumiose Gym battle.

32
00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:45.866
Pikachu.

33
00:01:45.933 --> 00:01:48.199
Well, it's probably a good idea to keep in mind

34
00:01:48.266 --> 00:01:50.433
that you haven't been in the Kalos region long.

35
00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:51.699
I've got an idea.

36
00:01:51.766 --> 00:01:55.033
Why don't you utilize this time to catch another Kalos Pokémon?

37
00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:56.633
Yeah, that's a good point!

38
00:01:56.699 --> 00:02:00.133
Now, where is my next Pokémon hanging out?

39
00:02:00.199 --> 00:02:01.333
- Pika. Pika.
- Huh?

40
00:02:01.399 --> 00:02:05.500
Hey, Ash? If you catch a really cute Pokémon, will you let me take care of it?

41
00:02:05.566 --> 00:02:07.866
- Sure! Of course!
- Yippee, yay!

42
00:02:07.933 --> 00:02:11.266
So, why did you decide to go on a journey, Serena?

43
00:02:11.333 --> 00:02:14.566
- Huh? Hmm.
- Pika. Pika.

44
00:02:14.633 --> 00:02:17.933
I wanted to give this back to you. It's yours!

45
00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:21.933
Huh?

46
00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:24.833
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

47
00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:28.266
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

48
00:02:28.333 --> 00:02:31.333
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

49
00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:34.166
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

50
00:02:34.299 --> 00:02:37.266
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me

51
00:02:37.333 --> 00:02:40.500
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

52
00:02:40.566 --> 00:02:43.933
♪ Pokémon, yeah, you're my best friend

53
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.366
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

54
00:02:46.433 --> 00:02:51.933
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all Pokémon ♪

55
00:03:01.666 --> 00:03:03.600
Ash, remember when we were talking about

56
00:03:03.666 --> 00:03:07.033
going to Professor Oak's Pokémon Summer Camp back when we were younger?

57
00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:08.000
Yeah.

58
00:03:08.066 --> 00:03:11.666
Well, you let me borrow this way back then.

59
00:03:11.733 --> 00:03:12.733
Huh?

60
00:03:12.799 --> 00:03:16.233
Where is everybody?

61
00:03:16.299 --> 00:03:18.399
Where did you all go?

62
00:03:18.466 --> 00:03:20.433
Oh!

63
00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:23.433
Oh

64
00:03:30.366 --> 00:03:34.799
I knew I didn't want to come to camp. I knew it!

65
00:03:34.866 --> 00:03:37.799
Mommy!

66
00:03:37.866 --> 00:03:40.733
-Huh?

67
00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:47.000
Poliwag!

68
00:03:47.066 --> 00:03:51.066
- Huh? Hey, are you all right?
- Huh?

69
00:03:51.133 --> 00:03:54.066
Hi! I'm Ash! Who are you?

70
00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:57.833
- What's wrong?
- I hurt my leg.

71
00:03:57.899 --> 00:04:02.066
Don't worry! See this? This'll make it better!

72
00:04:03.566 --> 00:04:07.299
Huh?

73
00:04:07.366 --> 00:04:09.833
- All done!
- Oh!

74
00:04:09.899 --> 00:04:14.966
Now, watch this! Feel better, feel better right away!

75
00:04:15.033 --> 00:04:18.800
Ouch! It still hurts! I can't stand up!

76
00:04:18.866 --> 00:04:22.000
Don't give up till it's over, okay?

77
00:04:22.066 --> 00:04:23.466
Come on!

78
00:04:23.533 --> 00:04:27.300
Huh? Oh.

79
00:04:29.233 --> 00:04:32.166
Uh!

80
00:04:32.233 --> 00:04:35.166
There you go!

81
00:04:35.233 --> 00:04:39.666
I think we should be getting back to the campsite! Okay, come on!

82
00:04:39.733 --> 00:04:42.400
Oh.

83
00:04:51.266 --> 00:04:54.099
- That's Ash's handkerchief?
- Denne!

84
00:04:54.166 --> 00:04:57.300
Yeah. I've been wanting to give it back to you for a long time now,

85
00:04:57.366 --> 00:04:59.166
but never had a chance to do it.

86
00:04:59.233 --> 00:05:01.300
- Thank you.
- Uh, sure.

87
00:05:01.366 --> 00:05:05.400
But then, when I saw the Garchomp news story on TV and saw it was you,

88
00:05:05.466 --> 00:05:08.000
I knew it was time for me to try to track you down!

89
00:05:08.066 --> 00:05:12.333
Hold on! Now I remember! You're the girl with the straw hat!

90
00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:16.800
Wow, that was you! And you came all that way for this?

91
00:05:16.866 --> 00:05:19.400
- Pikachu.
- Not just that.

92
00:05:19.466 --> 00:05:22.766
You see, I also really wanted to see you again,

93
00:05:22.833 --> 00:05:27.233
but I never guessed you wouldn't remember me at all. Hm!

94
00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:30.233
- Oh, yeah. Sorry.
- Pika! Pikachu!

95
00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:33.766
- Huh?
- Pika?

96
00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:36.066
What's that noise?

97
00:05:36.133 --> 00:05:38.300
- That?
- Pika?

98
00:05:40.866 --> 00:05:42.300
Whoa!

99
00:05:42.366 --> 00:05:44.099
- Oh!
- I knew it. Rhyhorn!

100
00:05:44.166 --> 00:05:46.099
There's more!

101
00:05:47.333 --> 00:05:49.800
Rhyhorn, the Spikes Pokémon.

102
00:05:49.866 --> 00:05:51.933
Rhyhorn recklessly charges straight ahead,

103
00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:55.500
trampling over anything that gets in its way.

104
00:05:55.566 --> 00:05:58.233
- What was that about?
- It's a Rhyhorn race.

105
00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:00.566
- Race?
- Huh?

106
00:06:00.633 --> 00:06:03.400
-What do you all think you're doing?

107
00:06:03.466 --> 00:06:05.266
You're not supposed to be here!

108
00:06:05.333 --> 00:06:08.133
You're standing right in the middle of the Rhyhorn racecourse!

109
00:06:08.266 --> 00:06:11.133
The Rhyhorn racecourse?

110
00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:14.099
This is Odyssey Village, where the Rhyhorn race begins.

111
00:06:16.066 --> 00:06:18.166
The course starts here at the village square,

112
00:06:18.233 --> 00:06:20.000
goes through the forest and comes back!

113
00:06:20.066 --> 00:06:25.099
Things are heating up here on day two of this exciting Rhyhorn race!

114
00:06:25.166 --> 00:06:27.933
In the lead is number five, Ian!

115
00:06:28.066 --> 00:06:31.200
Wow! A Rhyhorn race! Never seen one before!

116
00:06:31.266 --> 00:06:34.000
Rhyhorn races are really popular in the Kalos region.

117
00:06:34.066 --> 00:06:36.533
This is so awesome to watch!

118
00:06:36.599 --> 00:06:39.700
- Pika.
- Rhyhorn are so cute, too!

119
00:06:39.766 --> 00:06:43.500
You know, they even have special Rhyhorn racetracks in bigger cities!

120
00:06:43.566 --> 00:06:47.966
- This course is actually kind of easy.
- Really? You sure know a lot!

121
00:06:48.033 --> 00:06:49.633
Well, I guess so.

122
00:06:49.766 --> 00:06:53.866
Okay. An official Rhyhorn race consists of six Rhyhorn, see?

123
00:06:53.933 --> 00:06:56.033
- Wow.
- There's a special Rhyhorn race

124
00:06:56.099 --> 00:06:58.066
anyone can participate in tomorrow.

125
00:06:58.133 --> 00:07:01.700
Ash, if you're interested, you might want to give that race a try!

126
00:07:01.766 --> 00:07:04.233
You mean it? Great! I'm in!

127
00:07:04.299 --> 00:07:06.000
Pika! Pikachu!

128
00:07:07.266 --> 00:07:10.166
Choose your Rhyhorn for the race from these right here!

129
00:07:10.233 --> 00:07:12.099
- Cool!
- Pika.

130
00:07:12.166 --> 00:07:14.766
Go ahead and pick any Rhyhorn that interests you.

131
00:07:14.833 --> 00:07:16.933
You mean I can really choose my own?

132
00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:18.333
- Sure!
- Hm.

133
00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:20.700
- Pika!
- Well, I need to get back to work.

134
00:07:20.766 --> 00:07:23.233
- Have a great race, Ash! Bye!
- I will.

135
00:07:23.299 --> 00:07:25.099
Thanks for everything, Officer Jenny!

136
00:07:25.166 --> 00:07:27.833
- Wonder which one I should choose.

137
00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:30.166
Each one of them is so cute!

138
00:07:30.233 --> 00:07:32.833
- Hm.
- Huh? Ash, don't do that!

139
00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:37.900
If you approach a Rhyhorn from behind, it might begin to panic and then run!

140
00:07:37.966 --> 00:07:42.666
Do this. Come in from the front and move very slowly.

141
00:07:42.733 --> 00:07:45.166
There, there, it's okay.

142
00:07:45.233 --> 00:07:47.333
- See?
- Amazing.

143
00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:48.700
Pika!

144
00:07:48.766 --> 00:07:53.166
Now, this Rhyhorn seems to be gentle and really smart.

145
00:07:53.233 --> 00:07:55.433
Sounds good. Then I choose you!

146
00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:58.500
Nice to meet you, Rhyhorn!

147
00:07:58.566 --> 00:08:02.433
Wow, I'm impressed! Serena, you're so good at handling Rhyhorn.

148
00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:06.599
Thank you. See, the truth is my mother was a Rhyhorn racer

149
00:08:06.666 --> 00:08:10.466
and so she made sure I knew how to handle them from the time I was a little girl.

150
00:08:10.533 --> 00:08:14.299
Whoa! Does that mean you want to be a Rhyhorn racer too, Serena?

151
00:08:14.366 --> 00:08:17.500
Well, Rhyhorn racing is fine,

152
00:08:17.566 --> 00:08:22.566
but I wonder... there may be something I might like to do even more.

153
00:08:22.633 --> 00:08:25.166
So I haven't made any decision just yet.

154
00:08:25.233 --> 00:08:29.933
If you ask me, I'd say it sounds like you want to find your own path!

155
00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.166
Mm-hm.

156
00:08:31.233 --> 00:08:35.333
Hey, Serena, since you know so much about Rhyhorn racing,

157
00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:38.900
do you think you could teach me some of the basics like the rules and how to ride?

158
00:08:38.966 --> 00:08:41.433
- You mean me?
- Yeah. Please?

159
00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.666
Uh...

160
00:08:42.733 --> 00:08:46.066
You have so much experience. It would really be a big help.

161
00:08:46.133 --> 00:08:48.100
We don't really know anything at all.

162
00:08:48.166 --> 00:08:51.966
- Please, Serena! You're the expert.
- Well, I guess so.

163
00:08:52.033 --> 00:08:53.500
All right!

164
00:08:54.666 --> 00:08:58.333
The Twerp and Pikachu, we've been looking for those two!

165
00:08:58.400 --> 00:09:01.600
And they've got Rhyhorn racing on the brain.

166
00:09:01.666 --> 00:09:03.933
When you've got a Rhyhorn, you've got something!

167
00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:06.000
Wobba!

168
00:09:06.066 --> 00:09:10.466
They've got power to spare and reeling in a Rhyhorn and Pikachu is sure

169
00:09:10.533 --> 00:09:13.500
- to earn us the Boss's seal of approval!
- Grade A.

170
00:09:13.566 --> 00:09:15.199
Yeah. So let's catch them.

171
00:09:15.266 --> 00:09:18.000
- What do you say?
- Wobbuffet!

172
00:09:18.066 --> 00:09:20.900
Who's that Pokémon?

173
00:09:25.066 --> 00:09:27.066
It's Fennekin!

174
00:09:33.766 --> 00:09:35.500
Okay! I'm all set!

175
00:09:35.566 --> 00:09:37.600
You look great!

176
00:09:37.666 --> 00:09:40.199
- Pikachu.
- It suits you!

177
00:09:40.266 --> 00:09:44.366
Aw, thank you! I sewed these patches on my suit just for fun!

178
00:09:44.433 --> 00:09:45.833
Wow, they're so cute!

179
00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:49.566
- Ash, look!
- Awesome! Looking good!

180
00:09:49.633 --> 00:09:54.033
They call it Rhyhorn race fashion!

181
00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:56.266
- How do I look?
- Perfect!

182
00:09:57.600 --> 00:10:01.933
First, you approach the Rhyhorn slowly, so you won't startle it.

183
00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:03.500
Okay!

184
00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:08.900
Next, you put your foot on here and then boost yourself up.

185
00:10:08.966 --> 00:10:11.266
Like this? Argh!

186
00:10:11.333 --> 00:10:13.366
Ah! Oh.

187
00:10:13.433 --> 00:10:14.933
- Oh!
- Pika!

188
00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:17.466
Are you okay?

189
00:10:17.533 --> 00:10:20.800
Even getting on one of these is tougher than I thought.

190
00:10:20.866 --> 00:10:24.000
Of course. You need to practice!

191
00:10:24.066 --> 00:10:25.633
Right, practice!

192
00:10:26.633 --> 00:10:28.133
Here goes.

193
00:10:33.066 --> 00:10:36.566
- Oh, no.
- Pika! Pika!

194
00:10:36.633 --> 00:10:38.866
There's got to be a trick to doing it right.

195
00:10:38.933 --> 00:10:41.400
Do you think you could show me how it's done, Serena?

196
00:10:41.466 --> 00:10:43.766
- Huh? Oh...
- Come on!

197
00:10:43.833 --> 00:10:47.500
If I don't know how to get on, how am I going to be able to enter the race?

198
00:10:47.566 --> 00:10:50.166
Oh, okay. Now, watch me closely.

199
00:10:50.233 --> 00:10:52.199
Uh-huh.

200
00:10:52.266 --> 00:10:55.366
- Do this and you're up!
- That's great!

201
00:10:55.433 --> 00:10:57.600
- Serena, you're awesome!
- Pika!

202
00:10:57.666 --> 00:10:59.966
Well, I'm certainly impressed!

203
00:11:00.100 --> 00:11:01.433
Really?

204
00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:06.066
And when you want your Rhyhorn to walk, signal lightly with your feet.

205
00:11:06.133 --> 00:11:08.800
Look at it go! So cute!

206
00:11:08.866 --> 00:11:12.000
- Perfect form!
- Okay! So how do you run?

207
00:11:12.066 --> 00:11:14.166
How do you run? Huh?

208
00:11:16.766 --> 00:11:19.233
- Serena!
- What happened?

209
00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:21.166
Boy, that hurts.

210
00:11:27.566 --> 00:11:29.566
-Huh?

211
00:11:29.633 --> 00:11:33.633
Stop! That tickles! That tickles!

212
00:11:33.699 --> 00:11:36.933
-Huh? What's going on?

213
00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.100
It looks like, she's laughing!

214
00:11:39.166 --> 00:11:43.100
The Rhyhorn seem to really like Serena.

215
00:11:43.166 --> 00:11:45.600
Oh? Oh?

216
00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:53.466
Wait. Maybe it was just playing before.

217
00:11:53.533 --> 00:11:58.233
Hey, that's no fair! I want all those cutie Rhyhorn to tickle me too!

218
00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:00.866
- Wait, Bonnie!
- Pika!

219
00:12:00.933 --> 00:12:04.766
- Wow. Look at that!
- So cute!

220
00:12:04.833 --> 00:12:06.866
Rhyhorn are such sweeties!

221
00:12:10.266 --> 00:12:13.400
Now we're both a muddy mess.

222
00:12:13.466 --> 00:12:15.500
But it was so fun!

223
00:12:15.566 --> 00:12:18.133
-Wah! Oh!

224
00:12:18.199 --> 00:12:21.000
You've almost got it! That's the way!

225
00:12:21.066 --> 00:12:23.433
- Yay! Ride 'em, Ash!
- Na-na-na!

226
00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:26.933
How am I doing?

227
00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:29.166
Close your mouth! You'll bite your tongue!

228
00:12:29.233 --> 00:12:30.666
- Keep going!
- Okay.

229
00:12:30.733 --> 00:12:32.966
Be one with Rhyhorn! Huh?

230
00:12:33.033 --> 00:12:35.966
Stop talking! You'll bite your tongue!

231
00:12:36.033 --> 00:12:38.300
Okay. Ah!

232
00:12:38.366 --> 00:12:42.699
All right, here we go. Be one with Rhyhorn!

233
00:12:46.833 --> 00:12:48.666
Pika! Pika!

234
00:12:51.166 --> 00:12:52.633
Wow! It worked!

235
00:12:52.699 --> 00:12:55.300
- Pika!
- Way to go, Ash!

236
00:12:55.366 --> 00:12:58.400
Yeah! Now you're all ready to ride in the race!

237
00:12:58.466 --> 00:13:03.066
"If at first you don't succeed, try, try again." And that's what you did!

238
00:13:03.133 --> 00:13:05.666
Let's do the same thing tomorrow in the race!

239
00:13:05.733 --> 00:13:07.800
Pika! Pika!

240
00:13:07.866 --> 00:13:11.966
You're awesome Rhyhorn.

241
00:13:12.033 --> 00:13:15.033
Ash tries his hardest at everything he does.

242
00:13:15.099 --> 00:13:19.800
Maybe... Maybe I didn't really understand Rhyhorn racing in the first place.

243
00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:33.333
Fennekin!

244
00:13:34.333 --> 00:13:37.333
- We need to stay quiet!
- Fennekin.

245
00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:40.300
I hope they turn out all right.

246
00:13:42.933 --> 00:13:46.966
Folks, welcome to the Rhyhorn race's final day,

247
00:13:47.033 --> 00:13:50.033
the day when any racer can join in!

248
00:13:51.033 --> 00:13:52.966
Yay, Ash! You're going to win!

249
00:13:53.033 --> 00:13:55.866
- Thanks! I'll do my best!
- Pika! Pikachu!

250
00:13:55.933 --> 00:13:57.433
You heard her, Rhyhorn!

251
00:13:58.766 --> 00:14:01.933
Get set, go!

252
00:14:05.566 --> 00:14:07.566
That's not a good start.

253
00:14:07.633 --> 00:14:10.166
- I hope he's okay.
- I wonder.

254
00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:17.199
Okay! Now it's time to catch up and take the lead! Let's go!

255
00:14:17.266 --> 00:14:18.633
Pika!

256
00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:23.133
The Rhyhorn will be here any minute!

257
00:14:23.199 --> 00:14:24.866
Time to launch our plan!

258
00:14:24.933 --> 00:14:26.866
Okay, eh, Inkay?

259
00:14:26.933 --> 00:14:30.599
Inkay!

260
00:14:33.199 --> 00:14:34.966
- Huh?
- What happened?

261
00:14:35.033 --> 00:14:36.366
Must be a technical glitch.

262
00:14:39.133 --> 00:14:41.833
Uh-oh! We lost our live feed!

263
00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:45.266
Something must've happened out on the course but what?

264
00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:49.800
- Poor Ash.
- We should go investigate!

265
00:14:49.866 --> 00:14:51.966
Oh.

266
00:14:53.900 --> 00:14:56.300
That's weird. Where are the other Rhyhorn?

267
00:14:59.133 --> 00:15:01.800
Pikachu!

268
00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:13.766
- Rhy! Rhy! Rhy!
- Pika! Pikachu!

269
00:15:13.833 --> 00:15:16.733
Pikachu! Rhyhorn!

270
00:15:16.800 --> 00:15:19.633
What's going on around here?

271
00:15:19.699 --> 00:15:21.933
Ah. It's the other racers!

272
00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.633
Mission accomplished!

273
00:15:23.699 --> 00:15:25.633
Huh! Who said that?

274
00:15:25.699 --> 00:15:28.166
Prepare for trouble, who do you think?

275
00:15:28.233 --> 00:15:30.633
And make it double, with a nod and a wink.

276
00:15:30.699 --> 00:15:33.133
To protect the world from devastation!

277
00:15:33.199 --> 00:15:35.866
To unite all people within our nation!

278
00:15:35.933 --> 00:15:38.833
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

279
00:15:38.900 --> 00:15:42.400
To extend our reach to the stars above!

280
00:15:42.466 --> 00:15:44.833
- Jessie!
- And James!

281
00:15:44.900 --> 00:15:48.199
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

282
00:15:48.266 --> 00:15:50.566
Surrender now or prepare for a fight!

283
00:15:50.633 --> 00:15:53.466
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

284
00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:58.833
Team Rocket! Always trying to mess everything up!

285
00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:02.366
Pish-posh. We win and you lose.

286
00:16:02.433 --> 00:16:06.366
-Pikachu! Pika!

287
00:16:08.366 --> 00:16:10.366
-Pika! Pika!

288
00:16:10.433 --> 00:16:12.966
- Wobbuffet!
- All aboard the Rhyhorn express!

289
00:16:13.033 --> 00:16:16.366
Do we have Rhyhorn? Yes!

290
00:16:16.433 --> 00:16:18.866
And just what do you think you're going to do with them?

291
00:16:18.933 --> 00:16:24.233
It's such a bore if you have to ask. They'll help us conquer the world, silly!

292
00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:27.633
And, don't forget Pikachu! That will help too!

293
00:16:27.699 --> 00:16:30.400
- Pikachu!
- Wobbuffet!

294
00:16:30.466 --> 00:16:34.133
Since you're all tied up, we bid you bye, bye.

295
00:16:34.199 --> 00:16:37.099
- I want Pikachu back!
- Save it, twerp, got to fly.

296
00:16:37.166 --> 00:16:39.900
You won't get away with this!

297
00:16:45.099 --> 00:16:46.766
Uh, check, please.

298
00:16:46.833 --> 00:16:49.166
Bunnelby!

299
00:16:51.233 --> 00:16:57.400
Huh! Way to go, Bunnelby!

300
00:16:57.466 --> 00:16:59.466
Looks like we made it in time!

301
00:16:59.533 --> 00:17:01.800
- Clemont!
- Ash!

302
00:17:01.866 --> 00:17:04.866
- Are you okay?
- Serena! Bonnie!

303
00:17:04.933 --> 00:17:07.399
Wow! Am I glad to see you!

304
00:17:07.466 --> 00:17:09.766
I had a feeling something bad was happening,

305
00:17:09.833 --> 00:17:11.899
but I never imagined it would be like this.

306
00:17:11.966 --> 00:17:14.899
Bad is right! It's Team Rocket!

307
00:17:14.966 --> 00:17:17.899
Little brat! You'll pay for that mouth!

308
00:17:18.899 --> 00:17:22.766
- Fen! Fennekin!
- Huh. Oh. Right!

309
00:17:22.833 --> 00:17:26.933
Pikachu and the others are in trouble and you want to help them. That right?

310
00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:28.233
Fen!

311
00:17:30.399 --> 00:17:32.733
Fennekin, Ember!

312
00:17:39.733 --> 00:17:42.666
Oh!

313
00:17:42.733 --> 00:17:46.666
For the future of science. Ha!

314
00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:50.500
Pika!

315
00:17:50.566 --> 00:17:52.766
All of a sudden, I don't feel so good.

316
00:17:52.833 --> 00:17:55.266
Feels kind of drafty out here.

317
00:17:55.333 --> 00:17:58.200
You're feeling the winds of wipe out!

318
00:17:58.266 --> 00:17:59.933
Hey, relax!

319
00:18:00.066 --> 00:18:02.666
- Getting upset is bad for our health!
- Wobbuffet!

320
00:18:04.966 --> 00:18:09.066
We're blasting off instead!

321
00:18:09.133 --> 00:18:10.866
Wobbuffet!

322
00:18:11.866 --> 00:18:14.566
- Awesome! Thank you, everybody!
- Sure thing!

323
00:18:14.633 --> 00:18:16.600
- Are you okay, Ash?
- You bet!

324
00:18:16.666 --> 00:18:19.333
- Fennekin! Fen!
- Fennekin. Thanks!

325
00:18:19.399 --> 00:18:21.133
Huh?

326
00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:24.700
- Is everybody here all right?
- Officer Jenny!

327
00:18:24.766 --> 00:18:27.766
Yes! We're all fine!

328
00:18:27.833 --> 00:18:30.500
I need everybody to keep this area clear.

329
00:18:30.566 --> 00:18:33.700
I'll be coming to you individually to get your statements later.

330
00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:36.333
Fenne!

331
00:18:36.399 --> 00:18:39.300
I guess that means I can battle too.

332
00:18:42.899 --> 00:18:47.600
Nice to meet you! My name's Ash! This is my buddy Pikachu!

333
00:18:47.666 --> 00:18:51.366
- Pika, pika!
- I'm Clemont! Hi there! Oh! Oh!

334
00:18:51.433 --> 00:18:54.933
- My name's Bonnie! This is Dedenne! Ha-ha!
- Dedenne!

335
00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:57.833
- Take a look! Fennekin!
- Fenne!

336
00:18:57.899 --> 00:19:01.899
- You see, Fennekin's my brand new partner!
- Fennekin!

337
00:19:01.966 --> 00:19:06.633
Nice to meet you! I hope you'll take good care of my daughter!

338
00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:10.733
Know what Serena did? She taught me how to ride a Rhyhorn!

339
00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:13.566
Ash, you didn't have to tell her that, did you?

340
00:19:13.633 --> 00:19:16.233
Hey, it's the truth! And there's more!

341
00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:19.800
She told me to be one with Rhyhorn and that helped the most! Oh!

342
00:19:19.866 --> 00:19:21.433
Mom! Guess what?

343
00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:25.600
You see, I've decided I'm going to travel with Ash and all of his friends!

344
00:19:25.666 --> 00:19:27.466
Isn't that the best?

345
00:19:27.533 --> 00:19:30.566
Really? That's great! Have a good time!

346
00:19:30.633 --> 00:19:33.166
- Huh, Mom?
- I mean it!

347
00:19:33.233 --> 00:19:36.666
It will be a wonderful experience for you. I'm sure.

348
00:19:36.733 --> 00:19:39.399
Hm!

349
00:19:42.733 --> 00:19:48.399
Sorry I took so long! I'm going with you! Isn't that great?

350
00:19:48.466 --> 00:19:50.766
- Yeah, it sure is!
- Pika!

351
00:19:50.833 --> 00:19:53.300
We're going to have so many fun adventures!

352
00:19:53.366 --> 00:19:55.899
- And we'll be best friends!
- Dedenne!

353
00:19:55.966 --> 00:19:59.466
We sure will! Oh, yeah! Ash!

354
00:20:01.066 --> 00:20:03.733
- Here! For you!
- Huh? What's this?

355
00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:09.399
- Whoa! Cookies! They look awesome!
- Pikachu!

356
00:20:11.533 --> 00:20:15.200
It's a gift for all of your hard work!

357
00:20:15.266 --> 00:20:18.966
And also a thank you for when we were little!

358
00:20:19.033 --> 00:20:22.533
-Aw, why just Ash?

359
00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:24.600
Pika!

360
00:20:24.666 --> 00:20:26.833
You're eating way too fast!

361
00:20:26.899 --> 00:20:29.066
Hm. Hm?

362
00:20:30.133 --> 00:20:32.666
Don't worry! I made some for everyone!

363
00:20:32.733 --> 00:20:34.399
Yippee!

364
00:20:34.466 --> 00:20:36.766
- Wow, thank you very much!
- Pikachu!

365
00:20:36.833 --> 00:20:39.300
After doing his best at the Rhyhorn race,

366
00:20:39.366 --> 00:20:42.333
our hero enjoys a sweet reward for his efforts,

367
00:20:42.399 --> 00:20:47.466
while new adventures with new friends await, as the journey continues!
